&lt;h2&gt;data_dir&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="data_dir"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#data_dir" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The directory used for persisting Vertex state data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;timezone&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="timezone"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#timezone" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The name of the timezone to apply to timestamp conversions that do not contain
an explicit timezone.&lt;/p&gt;
